  "rewards": {
    nav: "Rewards", "kicker": "Nottera Rewards",
    "title": "Welcome to the ritual.",
    "body": "<p class=\"page-lead\">Nottera Rewards is our way of saying thank you — turn every good night into points and quiet perks.</p>\n<div id=\"rewardsBalance\"></div>\n<p class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"btn-rewards-cta\" href=\"{{ routes.account_url }}\">Join Now</a><a class=\"btn-rewards-cta\" href=\"{{ routes.account_url }}\">Sign In</a></p>\n<h3>Ways to earn</h3>\n<div class=\"rewards-ways\"><div class=\"rewards-way\"><span class=\"rewards-way-value\">100 pts</span><span class=\"rewards-way-label\">Join the ritual</span></div><div class=\"rewards-way\"><span class=\"rewards-way-value\">2 pts</span><span class=\"rewards-way-label\">Every $1 spent</span></div><div class=\"rewards-way\"><span class=\"rewards-way-value\">20 pts</span><span class=\"rewards-way-label\">Visit us each week</span></div></div>\n<h3>Redeem your points</h3>\n<div class=\"rewards-redeem\"><div class=\"rewards-redeem-card\"><span class=\"rewards-redeem-off\">$5 off</span><span class=\"rewards-redeem-pts\">200 points</span></div><div class=\"rewards-redeem-card\"><span class=\"rewards-redeem-off\">$10 off</span><span class=\"rewards-redeem-pts\">400 points</span></div><div class=\"rewards-redeem-card\"><span class=\"rewards-redeem-off\">$25 off</span><span class=\"rewards-redeem-pts\">1,200 points</span></div></div>\n<blockquote><p>Better nights, and a bonus for every ritual you keep with us.</p></blockquote>\n<h3>Program terms</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Nottera Rewards points have <strong>no cash value</strong> and cannot be sold, transferred, or redeemed for cash.</li>\n<li>Points are earned on the <strong>amount actually paid</strong> (after discounts, before shipping and tax) and are credited once an order is delivered and past the return window.</li>\n<li>If an order is <strong>returned or refunded</strong>, the points earned on that order are deducted from your balance, which may take your balance negative until your next earning event.</li>\n<li>Points <strong>expire after 12 months</strong> of account inactivity (no purchases, redemptions, or sign-in).</li>\n<li>We may <strong>change the earning rate or redemption values</strong> going forward, or end the program, with reasonable notice on this page; changes do not remove points you have already earned at the time of the change.</li>\n<li>We may suspend or close an account and forfeit its points for <strong>fraud, abuse, or violation of these Terms</strong> (e.g., fake accounts created to farm the welcome bonus).</li>\n<li>Rewards are unlocked once your Nottera account is created and become active after your first purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"page-muted\">See our <a href=\"#/terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for the rest of the rules that apply to your account and purchases.</p>"
  },
  "account": {
    nav: "Account", "kicker": "Account",
    "title": "Sign in or create your account.",
    "body": "<p class=\"page-lead\">Your Nottera account keeps your orders, addresses and rewards points in one calm place.</p>\n<div id=\"accountApp\"></div>\n<h3>What your account unlocks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Order history &amp; tracking</strong> — see every order and follow its tracking in one place.</li>\n<li><strong>Nottera Rewards</strong> — earn points on every purchase, for joining, and for visiting each week — then redeem them for discounts.</li>\n<li><strong>Early access</strong> — new launches and private sales before anyone else.</li>\n</ul>"
  },
  "about": {
    nav: "Our Story", "kicker": "Our Story",
    "title": "Better nights, by design.",
    "body": "<p class=\"page-lead\">Some nights, everything finally softens — a mind slowing down, a body letting go. That feeling is the whole reason Nottera exists.</p>\n<p>We started Nottera because rest had quietly become the thing we all sacrificed first. The world got louder and faster, and our nights paid for it. We wanted to build something small and considered that gives a little of that calm back — starting with the one thing you touch for a third of your life.</p>\n<h3>The problem we couldn't ignore</h3>\n<p>Most pillows flatten by 2am, run hot, or leave your neck aching by morning. Sleep — the foundation of how we feel, think and show up — was being treated as an afterthought. We thought it deserved better than a rectangle of foam and a marketing promise.</p>\n<h3>One pillow, shaped around you</h3>\n<p>So we designed the Nottera Pillow around the body instead of around trends: a contoured, ergonomic shape that cradles the head, opens the shoulders and keeps your spine aligned in every sleeping position. Breathable materials that stay cool. Two sizes — Crescent and Eclipse — so every sleeper finds their fit, no guesswork, no compromise.</p>\n<h3>What we believe</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rest isn't a luxury.</strong> It's the quiet foundation of a better day — and everyone deserves it.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiet quality over hype.</strong> We'd rather make one thing exceptionally well than a hundred things loudly.</li>\n<li><strong>Honesty in the details.</strong> Clear policies, a 3-year warranty, and a promise to make things right. No fine-print games.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><p>A calmer tomorrow begins tonight.</p></blockquote>\n<p>We're a young brand, and we'd rather earn your trust one night at a time than promise you a crowd that isn't there yet. That's what the 60-night trial is for — if your nights have felt harder than they should, we'd love for you to feel the difference for yourself.</p>\n<p class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#/pillow\">Discover Nottera</a></p>\n<p class=\"page-signature\">With care,<br>The Nottera team</p>"
  },
  "firstnight": {
    "kicker": "Welcome",
    "title": "Your first night.",
    "body": "<p class=\"page-lead\">You just opened the box. Here's what to do before you sleep on it.</p>\n<h3>1. Unwrap it flat</h3>\n<p>Let the pillow breathe for 20&ndash;30 minutes out of its packaging before you use it &mdash; it's compressed for shipping and needs a little time to come back to full loft.</p>\n<h3>2. Find your side</h3>\n<p>Every Nottera pillow has two heights in one: a higher side and a lower side. Tonight, try the higher side first if you sleep on your side or have broader shoulders; the lower side if you sleep on your back or stomach. If it's not right, flip it &mdash; we call this the <strong>Phase Flip</strong>, and most people do it at least once before they find their side.</p>\n<h3>3. Give it more than one night</h3>\n<p>Memory foam softens to your shape over the first several nights. Don't judge it on night one &mdash; you've got <strong>60 nights</strong> to decide either way, so there's no rush.</p>\n<h3>4. Start the 7-Night Reset</h3>\n<p>Inside your order (or in <a href=\"#guide\">the Nottera Sleep Guide</a>, free over $100) is the <strong>7-Night Reset</strong> &mdash; one small, research-backed change per night for a week. Most people notice a difference by night four.</p>\n<h3>5. Keep the card</h3>\n<p>The card in your box has a QR code back to this page, so you can find it again on night two, three, or thirty. Scan it, bookmark it, whatever's easiest.</p>\n<blockquote><p>Welcome to the Nocturne &mdash; we're glad you're here.</p></blockquote>\n<p class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#/journal\">Read the Journal</a></p>"
  },
  "terms": {
    nav: "Terms of Service", "kicker": "Legal",
    "title": "Terms of Service",
    "body": "<p><strong>Last updated: July 2026</strong></p>\n<h3>1.1 Agreement</h3>\n<p>These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of mynottera.com and any purchase you\nmake from Nottera. By using the site or placing an order, you agree to these Terms, our Privacy\nPolicy, and the other policies referenced here. If you do not agree, please do not use the site or\npurchase.</p>\n<h3>1.2 Eligibility</h3>\n<p>You must be at least 18 years old and able to form a binding contract. By ordering, you represent\nthat you meet these requirements and that the information you provide is accurate and complete.</p>\n<h3>1.3 Accounts</h3>\n<p>If you create an account, you are responsible for keeping your credentials confidential and for all\nactivity under your account. Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use.</p>\n<h3>1.4 Orders, acceptance, and cancellation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your order is an <strong>offer to buy</strong>. A contract is formed only when we send an order or shipping\n  confirmation. We may <strong>accept, decline, limit, or cancel</strong> any order, in whole or in part, for any\n  lawful reason.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>We may cancel or refuse orders that appear <strong>fraudulent, abusive, placed for resale, unusually\n  large, or that fail payment or identity verification</strong>. If we cancel a paid order, we refund the\n  amount charged for the cancelled items.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>We may <strong>limit quantities</strong> per person, household, or order.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>1.5 Pricing and errors</h3>\n<p>Prices are in <strong>US Dollars (USD)</strong> and may change at any time. Despite our efforts, products may\noccasionally be mispriced or described inaccurately. <strong>We reserve the right to correct errors and to\ncancel any affected order — even after it is confirmed or paid — and to issue a refund.</strong></p>\n<h3>1.6 Payment</h3>\n<p>By submitting payment information, you represent that you are authorized to use the