  "privacy": {
    nav: "Privacy Policy", "kicker": "Legal",
    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "body": "<p><strong>Last updated: July 2026</strong></p>\n<p>Nottera respects your privacy. This Policy explains what personal information we collect, why, how we\nshare it, and your rights. It is designed to comply with the EU/UK <strong>GDPR</strong>, the California\n<strong>CCPA/CPRA</strong>, and other applicable US state privacy laws.</p>\n<h3>2.1 Who we are</h3>\n<p>Nottera, mailing address available on request, is responsible for your personal information. Privacy\ncontact: support@mynottera.com.</p>\n<h3>2.2 Information we collect</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Identifiers &amp; contact data:</strong> name, email, phone, shipping/billing address.</li>\n<li><strong>Order data:</strong> items purchased, order value, transaction history.</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Payment data:</strong> processed by our payment providers; <strong>we do not store full card numbers</strong>. We\n  receive only limited data (e.g., last 4 digits, authorization result).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Account data:</strong> login credentials (stored securely), preferences.</p>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Communications:</strong> emails, messages, reviews, support requests.</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Device &amp; usage data:</strong> IP address, browser/device type, pages viewed, and similar analytics data\n  collected via cookies (see Cookie Policy).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Marketing data:</strong> subscription status and engagement.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2.3 Sources</h3>\n<p>Directly from you; automatically via cookies and similar technology; and from our service providers\n(such as payment, analytics, and fraud‑prevention providers).</p>\n<h3>2.4 How and why we use it (and GDPR legal bases)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Purpose</th>\n<th>GDPR legal basis</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Process and deliver orders; provide support</td>\n<td>Performance of a contract</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Send order and shipping updates</td>\n<td>Performance of a contract</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prevent fraud and abuse; secure our systems</td>\n<td>Legitimate interests / legal obligation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Marketing emails and offers</td>\n<td>Consent (and/or legitimate interests where permitted); opt out anytime</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Analytics and improving the site</td>\n<td>Consent (non‑essential cookies) / legitimate interests</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Comply with legal, tax, and accounting duties</td>\n<td>Legal obligation</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>2.5 How we share information</h3>\n<p>We share personal information only as needed to run our business:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Order fulfillment and delivery:</strong> we share your <strong>name, shipping address, and order details</strong>\n  with the <strong>fulfillment and shipping providers</strong> (including carriers) that prepare and deliver your\n  order.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Payment processors</strong> (to take payment and help prevent fraud).</p>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Technology, analytics, and marketing providers</strong> (site hosting, email, analytics, advertising).</li>\n<li><strong>Professional advisors, authorities, and successors</strong> (legal/tax advisors, lawful requests, or a\n  merger/asset sale).\nWe <strong>do not sell</strong> your personal information for money. Some sharing for analytics or advertising may\nqualify as a \"sale\" or \"share\" under certain US laws — you can opt out (see §2.9 and the Cookie\nPolicy).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2.6 Categories under CCPA/CPRA (last 12 months)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Category</th>\n<th>Collected</th>\n<th>Disclosed for a business purpose</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Identifiers (name, email, address, IP)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes (fulfillment, payment, analytics)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Commercial information (orders)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes (fulfillment, payment)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Internet/network activity</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes (analytics, advertising)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Approximate geolocation (from IP)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes (analytics, fraud prevention)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Financial info (payment token, last 4)</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes (payment processor)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>We do not \"sell\" personal information for money and do not knowingly process sensitive personal</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>information to infer characteristics.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>2.7 International transfers</h3>\n<p>Where we transfer personal data from the EEA/UK to countries without an adequacy decision, we rely on\nappropriate safeguards such as the EU <strong>Standard Contractual Clauses</strong> (and the UK Addendum where\nrelevant). Contact hello@mynottera.com for details.</p>\n<h3>2.8 Retention</h3>\n<p>We keep personal information only as long as necessary for the purposes above, including order\nrecords required for legal, tax, and accounting purposes, after which we delete or anonymize it.</p>\n<h3>2.9 Your rights</h3>\n<p><strong>EEA/UK (GDPR):</strong> access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection (including to\ndirect marketing), and withdrawal of consent at any time. You may also complain to your local data\nprotection authority.</p>\n<p><strong>California (CCPA/CPRA) and similar US state laws:</strong> the right to <strong>know/access</strong>, <strong>delete</strong>,\n<strong>correct</strong>, <strong>opt out of the sale/sharing</strong> of personal information and of targeted advertising,\n<strong>limit the use of sensitive personal information</strong>, and to <strong>non‑discrimination</strong> for exercising\nyour rights. You may use an authorized agent.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>To exercise a right:</strong> email hello@mynottera.com with enough information to verify your identity\n  (we cannot fulfill unverified requests, to protect your data).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>\"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" / opt out of targeted ads:</strong> email\n  hello@mynottera.com or use our cookie‑preference controls. We also honor recognized opt‑out\n  signals (such as Global Privacy Control) where required.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>We respond within the timeframes required by law (generally 30–45 days).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2.10 Marketing choices</h3>\n<p>Unsubscribe from marketing emails via the \"unsubscribe\" link or by contacting us. Transactional\nmessages (order and shipping updates) are not marketing and will still be sent.</p>\n<h3>2.11 Security</h3>\n<p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures (encryption in transit, access controls, and\nreputable providers). No method is 100% secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>\n<h3>2.12 Children</h3>\n<p>The site is not directed to children, and we do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 16 (or\nthe minimum age in your jurisdiction). If you believe a child provided data, contact\nhello@mynottera.com.</p>\n<h3>2.13 Cookies</h3>\n<p>See our <strong>Cookie Policy</strong>. We honor consent requirements for non‑essential cookies and provide\nopt‑out mechanisms.</p>\n<h3>2.14 Changes</h3>\n<p>We may update this Policy; material changes will be posted with a new date and, where required, we\nwill seek renewed consent.</p>\n<h3>2.15 Contact</h3>\n<p>support@mynottera.com.</p>"
  },
  "shipping": {
    nav: "Shipping", "kicker": "Support",
    "title": "Shipping",
    "body": "<p><strong>Last updated: July 2026</strong></p>\n<h3>3.1 Where we ship</h3>\n<p>We currently ship within the <strong>United States</strong>.</p>\n<h3>3.2 Processing time</h3>\n<p>Orders are processed within <strong>1–4 business days</strong> after payment and verification. Orders placed on\nweekends or holidays are processed the next business day.</p>\n<h3>3.3 Delivery time</h3>\n<p>Estimated delivery is <strong>7–14 business days</strong> after processing. Delivery windows are <strong>estimates, not\nguarantees</strong>, and may be affected by carrier performance, customs, weather, or peak periods.</p>\n<h3>3.4 Shipping cost</h3>\n<p>Standard shipping is free on every pillow, no minimum. Pillowcases and other accessories ship free on US orders over $65 (a flat rate applies below that, shown at checkout). Any\nexpedited options and costs are shown at checkout.</p>\n<h3>3.5 Tracking</h3>\n<p>When your order ships, we email a tracking link. Please allow a few days for tracking to update.</p>\n<h3>3.6 Accurate address</h3>\n<p>You are responsible for entering a <strong>complete, accurate shipping address</strong>. We are not responsible\nfor orders delayed, lost, or returned due to an incorrect or incomplete address. If a package is\nreturned for this reason, you are responsible for any <strong>re‑shipping cost</strong>, or you may request a\nrefund <strong>minus</strong> original shipping and handling.</p>\n<h3>3.7 Customs, duties, and taxes</h3>\n<p>We currently ship <strong>within the United States only</strong>. Because our orders are domestic US shipments,\n<strong>no import duties or customs fees apply</strong>. If we begin offering international shipping in the\nfuture, this section will be updated before any international orders are accepted.</p>\n<h3>3.8 Delays</h3>\n<p>We are not liable for delays caused by carriers, customs, or force‑majeure events. If your order is\nsignificantly delayed, contact hello@mynottera.com and we will investigate.</p>\n<h3>3.9 Lost, stolen, or damaged in transit</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Lost / not delivered:</strong> if tracking shows no delivery within the expected window, contact us\n  within <strong>30 days</strong> of the last tracking update. Once confirmed lost, we will arrange a\n  <strong>replacement or refund</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Marked delivered but not received:</strong> report within <strong>7 days</strong>; we will help open a carrier\n  investigation. Remedies depend on the carrier's findings.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Damaged on arrival:</strong> see the Return &amp; Refund Policy (report within 48 hours with photos).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3.10 Multiple packages</h3>\n<p>Items may ship separately and arrive on different dates at no extra cost to you.</p>"
  },
