  "returns": {
    nav: "Returns & Refunds", "kicker": "Support",
    "title": "Return & Refund",
    "body": "<p class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:support@mynottera.com?subject=Return%20request%20%E2%80%94%20Order%20%23&amp;body=Hi%20Nottera%20team%2C%0A%0AI%27d%20like%20to%20request%20a%20return%20or%20report%20an%20issue%20with%20my%20order.%0A%0AOrder%20number%3A%20%0AItem%28s%29%3A%20%0AReason%20%28change%20of%20mind%20/%20damaged%20/%20defective%20/%20wrong%20/%20missing%20/%20not%20delivered%29%3A%20%0A%0AIf%20the%20item%20is%20damaged%2C%20defective%2C%20wrong%2C%20or%20missing%2C%20please%20attach%20clear%20photos%20or%20a%20short%20video.%0A%0AThank%20you.\">Start a return</a></p><p class=\"page-muted\">This opens your email app with a ready-made template. You can also write to <a href=\"mailto:support@mynottera.com\">support@mynottera.com</a> with your order number and photos.</p><p><strong>Last updated: July 2026</strong></p>\n<p>We want you to love your Nottera products. Pillows come with our <strong>60‑Night Trial</strong>, described in §4.1 below. Pillowcases and other personal‑hygiene items follow a separate, standard change‑of‑mind policy in §4.2, since they cannot be resold once opened.</p>\n<h3>4.1 The 60‑Night Trial (pillows)</h3>\n<p>Every Nottera pillow comes with <strong>60 nights</strong> from the date of delivery to decide if it's right for you — used, slept on, flipped to either loft. If it isn't working out, contact us within the 60‑night window for a <strong>full refund</strong> to your original payment method. We provide a prepaid return label; you don't need to cover return shipping. Returned pillows are <strong>donated, not resold</strong>, so please return them reasonably clean.</p>\n<p>The 60‑Night Trial covers one return per pillow per customer, and does not apply to pillows that are damaged through misuse, or purchased through an unauthorized reseller. It runs alongside, and does not replace, your rights under §4.3 for defective, damaged, or wrong items.</p>\n<h3>4.2 Change‑of‑mind returns (pillowcases and other hygiene items)</h3>\n<p>For pillowcases, sleep masks, and similar personal‑hygiene items, you may request a return within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong> <strong>only if</strong> the item is <strong>unused, unwashed,\nand unopened</strong>, in its <strong>original sealed packaging</strong>, with all tags and inserts.</p>\n<p>For health and safety reasons, <strong>opened or used pillowcases, sleep masks, and similar hygiene items\ncannot be returned or refunded for change of mind.</strong> This does not affect your rights if an item is\ndefective, damaged, wrong, or lost (see §4.3).</p>\n<h3>4.2b Non‑returnable items</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Opened or used pillowcases, sleep masks, or other hygiene items (outside §4.1’s pillow trial).</li>\n<li>Digital products (such as the Digital Sleep Guide).</li>\n<li>Gift cards and items marked \"final sale.\"</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>4.3 Defective, damaged, wrong, missing, or lost items</h3>\n<p>You are fully covered in these cases. Contact us within the windows below with your order number and\n<strong>clear photos or a short video</strong> of the issue (and the packaging for transit damage):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Damaged in transit or defective on arrival:</strong> report within <strong>48 hours</strong> of delivery.</li>\n<li><strong>Wrong item, wrong size/variant, or missing item:</strong> report within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery.</li>\n<li><strong>Not delivered / lost in transit:</strong> report within <strong>30 days</strong> of the last tracking update.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If your claim qualifies, we will, at our option, <strong>send a free replacement or issue a refund</strong>. You\nusually will <strong>not</strong> need to ship the item back; if a return is required, we provide a prepaid label.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>\"Defective\" means a genuine manufacturing fault or damage that affects use — not the normal\ncharacteristics of memory foam, such as a slight new‑product scent that fades, natural softening\nover time, or minor variation in color or texture.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>4.4 How to start a return or claim</h3>\n<p>Email support@mynottera.com with: (1) your order number, (2) the item(s), (3) the reason, and (4) photos\nor video if reporting an issue. <strong>Do not</strong> ship anything back before receiving instructions —\nunauthorized returns may not be refunded.</p>\n<h3>4.5 Return shipping costs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Our error / defective / damaged / wrong item:</strong> we cover return shipping (if any) and the full\n  remedy.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>60‑Night Trial return (pillows, per §4.1):</strong> we provide a prepaid return label. The refund covers the item's purchase price; original outbound shipping (if any was charged) is not refunded.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Change‑of‑mind return (unopened, per §4.2):</strong> you cover return shipping, and the refund excludes\n  original shipping and handling. A restocking fee of up to 15% may apply.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>4.6 Refunds</h3>\n<p>Approved refunds are issued to your <strong>original payment method</strong> within <strong>5–10 business days</strong> after we\napprove the claim or receive the returned item. Your bank may take additional time to post it. We\ncannot refund to a different account or method.</p>\n<h3>4.7 Cancellations and changes</h3>\n<p>You may request to cancel or change an order within <strong>2 hours</strong> of placing it, before it enters\nfulfillment. After fulfillment begins, we cannot guarantee changes, and standard return rules apply.</p>\n<h3>4.8 Customs refusals and failed deliveries</h3>\n<p>Consistent with the Shipping Policy, orders that are undeliverable, returned, destroyed, or delayed\nbecause the recipient <strong>refused to pay duties/taxes, failed customs clearance, or provided an\nincorrect address</strong> are <strong>not eligible for a refund</strong>.</p>\n<h3>4.9 Fair‑use</h3>\n<p>We may refuse, limit, or investigate returns and refunds that appear fraudulent, excessive, or in bad\nfaith, and may require additional verification. Approved remedies are provided in good faith and are\nnot an admission of liability.</p>\n<h3>4.10 Billing disputes</h3>\n<p>Please contact us before disputing a charge — we resolve most issues within 24 hours. Bad‑faith\ndisputes (for example, after delivery, or in place of a return) will be contested with evidence.</p>\n<h3>4.11 Your statutory rights</h3>\n<p>Nothing in this policy limits any non‑waivable rights you may have under applicable consumer law.</p>"
